  <metadata>
    <name>Crown Stub 100 course</name>
    <desc>The Crown Stub 100 course from the Hilltop Day Use Area at L.L. Stub Stewart State Park in Buxton, OR, with out-and-backs to the Hwy 30 and Banks turnarounds on the Banks-Vernonia trail system. Track points and elevations copy the Crown Stub 100 line on the organizer's CalTopo course map (m/BEDR0FU, linked from the Course Maps/GPX page; retrieved 2026-08-13); station waypoints copy the map's markers. The line GPS-measures 98.62 miles against the aid chart's 100.2-mile cumulative frame, which governs pass miles.</desc>
    <link href="https://caltopo.com/m/BEDR0FU"><text>Crown Stub 100 CalTopo course map</text></link>
  </metadata>
